«
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  PoissPDF
  @  Density (or mass) at X.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 2; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 2 ≠ THEN "PoissPDF: needs 2 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → λv Xv « λv 0 + Xv 0 + → λ X « 'IFTE(X<0;0;IFTE(X>λ+40*√(λ);0;(λ^IP(X))*EXP(-λ)/(IP(X)!)))' →Num λv Xv 2 →List Drop » »
»
